{
  "lessonId": "L2M2L4",
  "title": "Abruzzo 阿布魯佐",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b 0%,#e74c3c 100%)'><h1>🏔️ Abruzzo</h1><p class='subtitle'>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo 的家鄉</p></section><section class='slide abruzzo-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='abruzzo-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='abruzzo-map' class='abruzzo-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🏔️ Abruzzo 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(192,57,43,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo 的家鄉，山與海之間的高性價比紅酒</p></div><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.4rem;border-bottom:3px solid #c0392b;padding-bottom:10px;'>📍 Abruzzo 產區地圖</h3><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>大區邊界</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;border:3px solid #c0392b;margin-right:10px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Abruzzo 大區</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>S級 DOCG 🏆</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#d4af37;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;font-weight:600;'>Montepulciano d''Abruzzo Colline Teramane DOCG</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>A級 DOC ⭐</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e74c3c;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Montepulciano d''Abruzzo DOC（紅酒）</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#f39c12;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Trebbiano d''Abruzzo DOC（白酒）</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>B級 DOC 產區</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:30px;height:20px;background:#e91e63;margin-right:10px;border-radius:3px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>Cerasuolo d''Abruzzo DOC（粉紅酒）</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>重要城市</h4><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;'><div style='width:12px;height:12px;background:#c0392b;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid white;margin-right:10px;'></div><span style='color:#ecf0f1;'>L''Aquila, Pescara, Teramo, Chieti</span></div></div><div class='legend-section'><h4 style='margin:15px 0 10px;color:#f8f9fa;font-size:1.1rem;'>操作提示</h4><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 滑鼠懸停查看產區名稱</p><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 點擊產區查看詳細資訊</p><p style='color:#bdc3c7;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0;'>• 點擊城市標記查看說明</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏔️ 山與海之間</h2><div class='region-intro'><div class='intro-text'><p>Abruzzo（阿布魯佐）位於義大利中部，西有<strong>Apennine 山脈</strong>，東臨<strong>Adriatic 海</strong>，以<strong>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo 紅酒</strong>和<strong>Trebbiano d'Abruzzo 白酒</strong>聞名全球。</p><p class='highlight'>Abruzzo 是義大利葡萄酒產量第五大的產區，以高性價比著稱。</p></div><div class='abruzzo-geography'><div class='geo-card mountains'><div class='geo-icon'>🏔️</div><h4>Gran Sasso 山脈</h4><p>義大利最高峰<br>海拔 2912m<br>為葡萄園提供冷空氣</p></div><div class='geo-card hills'><div class='geo-icon'>🌄</div><h4>丘陵葡萄園</h4><p>海拔 200-500m<br>日夜溫差大<br>保留酸度和香氣</p></div><div class='geo-card coast'><div class='geo-icon'>🌊</div><h4>Adriatic 海岸</h4><p>海風調節溫度<br>延長成熟期<br>帶來礦物感</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Montepulciano d'Abruzzo DOC</h2><div class='montepulciano-section'><div class='montepulciano-intro'><h3>🍷 義大利性價比之王</h3><p>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo（注意：不是 Tuscany 的 <strong>Vino Nobile di Montepulciano</strong>）是世界上<strong>最超值的義大利紅酒</strong>之一，價格親民、品質穩定。</p><div class='clarification'><h4>⚠️ 名稱辨識</h4><table><tr><th>酒款名稱</th><th>品種</th><th>產區</th></tr><tr><td><strong>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo</strong></td><td>Montepulciano 品種</td><td>Abruzzo</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vino Nobile di Montepulciano</strong></td><td>Sangiovese 品種</td><td>Tuscany</td></tr></table></div></div><div class='montepulciano-details'><div class='detail-card'><h4>🍇 品種與風格</h4><p><strong>品種：</strong>Montepulciano（85%+），可混 Sangiovese</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>果香豐富、柔順、中至飽滿酒體</p><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、李子、紫羅蘭、香料、草本</p><p><strong>單寧：</strong>柔順、成熟</p><p><strong>酸度：</strong>中等</p><p><strong>酒精度：</strong>12-13.5%</p></div><div class='detail-card'><h4>🏆 品質分級</h4><p><strong>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo DOC：</strong>基本款</p><p><strong>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo Colline Teramane DOCG：</strong></p><ul><li>來自 Teramo 省的高品質子產區</li><li>2003 年升級為 DOCG</li><li>陳年要求：2 年（Riserva 3 年）</li><li>酒精度：12.5%+</li><li>風格更濃郁、結構更強、陳年潛力更佳</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Montepulciano 品種特性</h2><div class='grape-characteristics'><div class='char-intro'><h3>🍇 晚熟、高產、適應力強</h3></div><div class='char-grid'><div class='char-card'><h4>⏰ 成熟期</h4><p><strong>晚熟品種</strong>（10 月中至 11 月初）</p><p>需要溫暖氣候和長成熟期</p><p>海岸地區成熟度更好</p></div><div class='char-card'><h4>🍇 產量</h4><p><strong>天然高產</strong></p><p>需要嚴格控制產量以提升品質</p><p>頂級生產者限制產量在 8-10 噸/公頃</p></div><div class='char-card'><h4>🎨 顏色</h4><p><strong>極深的紫紅色</strong></p><p>富含花青素（Anthocyanin）</p><p>常用於混釀增加顏色</p></div><div class='char-card'><h4>🌍 氣候適應</h4><p><strong>適應多種氣候</strong></p><p>耐寒、耐旱</p><p>在 Abruzzo 的山與海之間表現最佳</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⚪ Trebbiano d'Abruzzo DOC</h2><div class='trebbiano-section'><div class='trebbiano-intro'><h3>🍾 被低估的優質白酒</h3><p>Trebbiano d'Abruzzo 過去以<strong>大量生產的低價酒</strong>著稱，但近年有生產者證明它能釀出<strong>高品質、有陳年潛力</strong>的白酒。</p></div><div class='trebbiano-comparison'><div class='comparison-card old'><h4>❌ 傳統低品質版本</h4><ul><li>高產量（150-200 公頃/噸）</li><li>過早採收</li><li>大型不銹鋼桶快速釀造</li><li>風味單薄、酸度低</li><li>價格極低（€5 以下）</li></ul></div><div class='comparison-card new'><h4>✅ 現代高品質版本</h4><ul><li>限制產量（50-70 公頃/噸）</li><li>適當成熟度採收</li><li>橡木桶或不銹鋼精心釀造</li><li>風味：白桃、杏桃、柑橘、杏仁、礦物</li><li>陳年潛力：5-10 年</li><li>酒精度：12.5-13.5%</li><li>代表酒莊：Valentini, Emidio Pepe</li></ul></div></div><div class='trebbiano-note'><p><strong>💡 重要提示：</strong>Trebbiano d'Abruzzo（更正確名稱：Trebbiano Abruzzese 或 Bombino Bianco）與常見的 Trebbiano Toscano 是<strong>不同品種</strong>，品質潛力更高。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌸 Cerasuolo d'Abruzzo DOC</h2><div class='cerasuolo-section'><div class='cerasuolo-intro'><h3>🌸 義大利最佳粉紅酒之一</h3><p>Cerasuolo（意為「櫻桃色」）是用<strong>Montepulciano 葡萄</strong>釀造的粉紅酒，風格介於<strong>Rosé 和輕紅酒之間</strong>，色澤深邃、風味濃郁。</p></div><div class='cerasuolo-details'><div class='cerasuolo-card'><h4>🍇 釀造方式</h4><p><strong>浸皮時間：</strong>4-12 小時（比一般 Rosé 更長）</p><p><strong>顏色：</strong>深粉紅至淺紅（櫻桃紅）</p><p><strong>發酵：</strong>不銹鋼桶或部分橡木桶</p></div><div class='cerasuolo-card'><h4>🍷 風味特徵</h4><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、草莓、覆盆莓、紫羅蘭、香料</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>乾型、果香豐富、酒體中等</p><p><strong>酸度：</strong>清爽</p><p><strong>單寧：</strong>輕微（比白葡萄酒多，比紅葡萄酒少）</p></div><div class='cerasuolo-card'><h4>🍽️ 配餐</h4><ul><li>🍝 番茄醬義大利麵</li><li>🍤 烤海鮮、魚</li><li>🥗 夏季沙拉</li><li>🍕 Pizza</li><li>🧀 新鮮起司</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎯 如何挑選優質 Abruzzo 葡萄酒</h2><div class='selection-guide'><div class='guide-section red'><h3>🍷 紅酒挑選指南</h3><div class='tips'><div class='tip-card'><h4>1️⃣ 選擇 Colline Teramane DOCG</h4><p>品質最穩定，值得陳年</p></div><div class='tip-card'><h4>2️⃣ 尋找 Riserva</h4><p>陳年 3 年，更複雜、更優雅</p></div><div class='tip-card'><h4>3️⃣ 小型酒莊</h4><p>產量控制更嚴格，品質更高</p></div><div class='tip-card'><h4>4️⃣ 知名生產者</h4><p>Emidio Pepe, Valentini, Masciarelli, Cataldi Madonna, Tiberio</p></div></div></div><div class='guide-section white'><h3>⚪ 白酒挑選指南</h3><div class='tips'><div class='tip-card'><h4>1️⃣ 避免廉價版本</h4><p>€10 以下的 Trebbiano 通常品質不佳</p></div><div class='tip-card'><h4>2️⃣ 尋找知名生產者</h4><p>Valentini（頂級，價格高）<br>Emidio Pepe（有機，品質優）<br>Tiberio（現代風格）</p></div><div class='tip-card'><h4>3️⃣ 檢查產量資訊</h4><p>標籤寫「低產量」「精選」的版本</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ Abruzzo 美食與配餐</h2><div class='abruzzo-cuisine'><div class='cuisine-intro'><h3>🐑 山區料理與海鮮的結合</h3><p>Abruzzo 料理融合了<strong>山區的肉類、起司</strong>和<strong>海岸的海鮮</strong>，風格樸實、食材優質。</p></div><div class='food-grid'><div class='food-card'><h4>🍝 Arrosticini</h4><p class='dish-desc'>羊肉串（Abruzzo 最代表性料理）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo</li><li>Montepulciano Colline Teramane Riserva</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🍝 Maccheroni alla Chitarra</h4><p class='dish-desc'>吉他麵（用吉他狀工具製作的義大利麵）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo（配肉醬）</li><li>Trebbiano d'Abruzzo（配海鮮）</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🦞 Brodetto di Pesce</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Abruzzo 式魚湯</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>Trebbiano d'Abruzzo</li><li>Cerasuolo d'Abruzzo</li></ul></div><div class='food-card'><h4>🧀 Pecorino Abruzzese</h4><p class='dish-desc'>Abruzzo 羊奶起司</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong></p><ul><li>陳年 Montepulciano（陳年起司）</li><li>Trebbiano（新鮮起司）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Montepulciano d'Abruzzo 是義大利性價比最高的紅酒之一</div><div class='point'>✓ Montepulciano d'Abruzzo ≠ Vino Nobile di Montepulciano（不同品種、不同產區）</div><div class='point'>✓ Colline Teramane DOCG 是 Montepulciano 的最高品質分級</div><div class='point'>✓ Trebbiano d'Abruzzo 在頂級生產者手中能釀出優質白酒</div><div class='point'>✓ Cerasuolo d'Abruzzo 是義大利最佳粉紅酒之一，色澤深邃、風味濃郁</div><div class='point'>✓ 挑選 Abruzzo 酒要注意生產者和產量控制</div></div></section></div><style>.region-intro{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.intro-text{margin-bottom:25px}.intro-text p{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin:0 0 15px}.highlight{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fadbd8,#fce4ec);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #c0392b;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.abruzzo-geography{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.geo-card{background:#fff;padding:30px 25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.geo-card.mountains{border-color:#95a5a6}.geo-card.hills{border-color:#f39c12}.geo-card.coast{border-color:#3498db}.geo-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:15px}.geo-card h4{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:1.2rem;color:#2c3e50}.geo-card p{margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.montepulciano-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.montepulciano-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:25px}.montepulciano-intro h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.4rem}.montepulciano-intro>p{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;padding:0 30px}.clarification{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fdebd0);padding:20px 25px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:20px}.clarification h4{margin:0 0 12px;color:#e67e22;font-size:1.1rem;text-align:center}.clarification table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px}.clarification th{background:#e67e22;color:#fff;padding:12px;text-align:left}.clarification td{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;line-height:1.6}.clarification tr:hover{background:rgba(243,156,18,.1)}.montepulciano-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.detail-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #c0392b}.detail-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.2rem}.detail-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.detail-card ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.detail-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.grape-characteristics{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.char-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8daef,#f4ecf7);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.char-intro h3{margin:0;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.4rem}.char-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.char-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px 20px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #8e44ad;text-align:center}.char-card h4{margin:0 0 12px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem}.char-card p{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem}.trebbiano-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.trebbiano-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d6eaf8,#ebf5fb);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.trebbiano-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.4rem}.trebbiano-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.trebbiano-comparison{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;margin-bottom:20px}.comparison-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border-top:6px solid}.comparison-card.old{border-color:#95a5a6}.comparison-card.new{border-color:#27ae60}.comparison-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;font-size:1.2rem}.comparison-card.old h4{color:#95a5a6}.comparison-card.new h4{color:#27ae60}.comparison-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:25px;line-height:2}.trebbiano-note{background:#d5f4e6;border-left:5px solid #27ae60;padding:15px 20px;border-radius:8px}.trebbiano-note p{margin:0;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.trebbiano-note strong{color:#27ae60}.cerasuolo-section{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.cerasuolo-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fce4ec,#f8bbd0);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.cerasuolo-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#e91e63;font-size:1.4rem}.cerasuolo-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.cerasuolo-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.cerasuolo-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #e91e63}.cerasuolo-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#e91e63;font-size:1.1rem}.cerasuolo-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.cerasuolo-card ul{margin:10px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.cerasuolo-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.selection-guide{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.guide-section{margin-bottom:25px}.guide-section:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.guide-section h3{margin:0 0 20px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:3px solid}.guide-section.red h3{color:#c0392b;border-color:#c0392b}.guide-section.white h3{color:#3498db;border-color:#3498db}.tips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}.guide-section.white .tips{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.tip-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid #27ae60}.tip-card h4{margin:0 0 10px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1rem}.tip-card p{margin:0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50;font-size:.95rem}.abruzzo-cuisine{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.cuisine-intro{text-align:center;padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3cd,#ffe69c);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.cuisine-intro h3{margin:0 0 12px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.3rem}.cuisine-intro p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50}.food-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.food-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #d35400}.food-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.2rem}.dish-desc{color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:.95rem}.food-card p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.7}.food-card ul{margin:5px 0;padding-left:25px;line-height:1.9}.food-card strong{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fadbd8,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "Montepulciano d'Abruzzo 與 Vino Nobile di Montepulciano 的差別是？",
      "options": [
        "相同酒款，不同名稱",
        "品種和產區都不同",
        "只有產區不同",
        "只有陳年時間不同"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Montepulciano d'Abruzzo 使用 Montepulciano 品種，產自 Abruzzo；Vino Nobile di Montepulciano 使用 Sangiovese 品種，產自 Tuscany。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Montepulciano d'Abruzzo 的最高品質分級是？",
      "options": [
        "Classico",
        "Superiore",
        "Colline Teramane DOCG",
        "Gran Selezione"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Montepulciano d'Abruzzo Colline Teramane 在 2003 年升級為 DOCG，是該產區的最高品質分級。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Cerasuolo d'Abruzzo 的特點是？",
      "options": [
        "甜型白酒",
        "加烈酒",
        "深色粉紅酒（用 Montepulciano 釀造）",
        "氣泡酒"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Cerasuolo（櫻桃色）是用 Montepulciano 葡萄釀造的粉紅酒，浸皮時間較長，呈現深粉紅至淺紅色。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Trebbiano d'Abruzzo 與 Trebbiano Toscano 的關係是？",
      "options": [
        "相同品種",
        "不同品種，Abruzzese 品質潛力更高",
        "只是名稱不同",
        "Toscano 品質更高"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Trebbiano d'Abruzzo（更正確名稱：Trebbiano Abruzzese 或 Bombino Bianco）與 Trebbiano Toscano 是不同品種，品質潛力更高。"
    }
  ]
}